# Code owners
#
# One human owner per pipeline domain (see AGENTS.md for the full multi-agent
# ownership matrix). GitHub requires a *user or team* login here, so each block
# names the human accountable for the domain the agent pipeline assigns it to —
# the agent is the implementer, the listed owner is the reviewer.
#
# Add teammates here as they join; a path with no owner falls back to the
# repository default and gets no code-owner review requirement.

# ── Default ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Anything not claimed below. The owner must at least be aware of changes to
# docs, scripts and config, which are cross-cutting by nature.
*                                       @Rossy0109

# ── ATLAS — Accounting: schema, invariants, idempotency ─────────────────────
# God-files are ATLAS-led; proposals go through an owner review, not a direct
# edit by a frontend or backend agent.
/drizzle/                              @Rossy0109
/drizzle/schema.ts                    @Rossy0109
/server/db.ts                         @Rossy0109
/server/accounting-core.ts             @Rossy0109

# ── SENTINEL — Security: auth, sessions, RBAC, rate limits, secrets ─────────
/server/_core/env.ts                  @Rossy0109
/server/rbac*.ts                      @Rossy0109
/server/_core/idempotency.ts          @Rossy0109
/worker/                              @Rossy0109

# ── FORGE — Backend: Express, tRPC routers, middleware, jobs ────────────────
/server/routers.ts                    @Rossy0109
/server/routers/                      @Rossy0109
/server/_core/app.ts                  @Rossy0109
/server/_core/index.ts                @Rossy0109
/api/                                 @Rossy0109

# ── PRISM — Frontend ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
/client/                              @Rossy0109

# ── GUARDIAN — Gates, tests, migrations, CI ─────────────────────────────────
# Test files and CI configuration: changes here can weaken a release gate, so
# they always get an explicit review.
/.github/                             @Rossy0109
/scripts/                             @Rossy0109
**/*.test.ts                          @Rossy0109

